 ## Installation

 ### For Linux
-    sudo apt-get update
-    sudo apt-get install portaudio19-dev python-all-dev
-    sudo apt-get install ffmpeg
+Tested on **Ubuntu 22.04** (other distributions may differ slightly).
+
+```bash
+sudo apt-get update
+
+# Install audio dependencies
+sudo apt-get install portaudio19-dev python3-dev
+
+# Install video/image dependencies
+sudo apt-get install ffmpeg libsm6 libxext6
+
+# Ensure Python3 and pip are up to date
+sudo apt-get install python3-pip
+pip3 install --upgrade pip
+```
+
+### For macOS (via Homebrew)
+```bash
+brew install portaudio ffmpeg
+```
+
+### For Windows (via Chocolatey or manual install)
+```bash
+choco install portaudio ffmpeg
+```
+
+> 💡 **Note:** Some image processing libraries (like OpenCV) may require `libsm6` and `libxext6` on Linux.
+> These have been added above to prevent runtime errors such as `error while loading shared libraries: libXext.so.6`.
